<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Community lost & found</p><h1>Bring lost things<br>back <em>home.</em></h1><p class="lead">A kinder, simpler place for your community to report, search, and reunite with what matters.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/items/new">Report an item <b>→</b></a><a class="text-link" href="/items">Browse listings</a></div><div class="trust"><span>✦</span> Free for everyone. Built for good.</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="sun"></div><div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div><div class="card floating"><span class="tag found">FOUND</span><strong>Silver keyring</strong><small>Central Library · Today</small></div><div class="card lower"><span class="tag lost">LOST</span><strong>Blue water bottle</strong><small>North Campus · Yesterday</small></div><div class="illustration">⌕<div class="spark">✦</div></div></div></section>
<section class="stats"><div><b><%= stats.lost %></b><span>Items looking<br>for their way back</span></div><div><b><%= stats.found %></b><span>Kind people who<br>found something</span></div><div><b><%= stats.resolved %></b><span>Happy reunions<br>made possible</span></div></section>
<section class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Fresh from the community</p><h2>Recent reports</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/items">View all listings →</a></section><section class="grid"><% recent.forEach(item=>{ %><article class="item-card"><a class="item-image" href="/items/<%= item._id %>"><% if(item.image){ %><img src="<%= item.image %>" alt="<%= item.title %>"><% } else { %><span><%= item.category==='Keys'?'🔑':item.category==='Electronics'?'📱':'◌' %></span><% } %></a><div class="item-body"><div><span class="tag <%= item.type %>"><%= item.type %></span><span class="date"><%= new Date(item.date).toLocaleDateString() %></span></div><h3><a href="/items/<%= item._id %>"><%= item.title %></a></h3><p>⌖ <%= item.location %></p></div></article><% }) %><% if(!recent.length){ %><p>No reports yet. Be the first to help!</p><% } %></section>
<section class="how"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Small actions, big reunions.</h2><div class="steps"><div><i>1</i><h3>Report it</h3><p>Share what you lost or found in less than a minute.</p></div><div><i>2</i><h3>Connect safely</h3><p>Browse matches and submit a claim with identifying details.</p></div><div><i>3</i><h3>Make the return</h3><p>Confirm ownership and arrange a safe handover.</p></div></div></section>
